    <string name="auth_help_title">Moving accounts in and out</string>
    <string name="auth_help">Live sync between Bolt and Google Authenticator is not possible — Google keeps that data locked to its own app (end-to-end encrypted, no API). QR transfer is the sanctioned way in both directions:\n\n● Google Authenticator → Bolt: in the Google app open the ⋮ menu → Transfer accounts → Export accounts, screenshot the QR code, then here: + → Import from Google Authenticator and pick the screenshot. With more than 10 accounts Google shows several QR codes — import each one.\n\n● Bolt → Google Authenticator: long-press an account here → Show QR code, then in the Google app tap + → Scan a QR code.\n\nBolt never sends your secrets anywhere — decoding and code generation happen on this device.</string>
